action-cardinality-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-cardinality-behavior;4.0.1;ActionCardinalityBehavior;ActionCardinalityBehavior;draft;False;Defines behavior for an action or a group for how many times that item may be repeated.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;single;Single;The action may only be selected one time.;;;
