action-condition-kind;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-condition-kind;4.0.1;ActionConditionKind;ActionConditionKind;draft;False;Defines the kinds of conditions that can appear on actions.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;applicability;Applicability;The condition describes whether or not a given action is applicable.;;;
