action-grouping-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-grouping-behavior;4.0.1;ActionGroupingBehavior;ActionGroupingBehavior;draft;False;Defines organization behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;visual-group;Visual Group;Any group marked with this behavior should be displayed as a visual group to the end user.;;;
action-grouping-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-grouping-behavior;4.0.1;ActionGroupingBehavior;ActionGroupingBehavior;draft;False;Defines organization behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;logical-group;Logical Group;A group with this behavior logically groups its sub-elements, and may be shown as a visual group to the end user, but it is not required to do so.;;;
action-grouping-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-grouping-behavior;4.0.1;ActionGroupingBehavior;ActionGroupingBehavior;draft;False;Defines organization behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;sentence-group;Sentence Group;"A group of related alternative actions is a sentence group if the target referenced by the action is the same in all the actions and each action simply constitutes a different variation on how to specify the details for the target. For example, two actions that could be in a SentenceGroup are ""aspirin, 500 mg, 2 times per day"" and ""aspirin, 300 mg, 3 times per day"". In both cases, aspirin is the target referenced by the action, and the two actions represent different options for how aspirin might be ordered for the patient. Note that a SentenceGroup would almost always have an associated selection behavior of ""AtMostOne"", unless it's a required action, in which case, it would be ""ExactlyOne"".";;;
action-participant-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-participant-type;4.0.1;ActionParticipantType;ActionParticipantType;draft;False;The type of participant for the action.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;patient;Patient;The participant is the patient under evaluation.;;;
action-participant-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-participant-type;4.0.1;ActionParticipantType;ActionParticipantType;draft;False;The type of participant for the action.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;practitioner;Practitioner;The participant is a practitioner involved in the patient's care.;;;
action-participant-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-participant-type;4.0.1;ActionParticipantType;ActionParticipantType;draft;False;The type of participant for the action.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;related-person;Related Person;The participant is a person related to the patient.;;;
action-participant-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-participant-type;4.0.1;ActionParticipantType;ActionParticipantType;draft;False;The type of participant for the action.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;device;Device;The participant is a system or device used in the care of the patient.;;;
action-precheck-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-precheck-behavior;4.0.1;ActionPrecheckBehavior;ActionPrecheckBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection frequency behavior for an action or group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;yes;Yes;"An action with this behavior is one of the most frequent action that is, or should be, included by an end user, for the particular context in which the action occurs. The system displaying the action to the end user should consider ""pre-checking"" such an action as a convenience for the user.";;;
action-precheck-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-precheck-behavior;4.0.1;ActionPrecheckBehavior;ActionPrecheckBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection frequency behavior for an action or group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;no;No;"An action with this behavior is one of the less frequent actions included by the end user, for the particular context in which the action occurs. The system displaying the actions to the end user would typically not ""pre-check"" such an action.";;;
action-relationship-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-relationship-type;4.0.1;ActionRelationshipType;ActionRelationshipType;draft;False;Defines the types of relationships between actions.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;before-start;Before Start;The action must be performed before the start of the related action.;;;
