action-required-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-required-behavior;4.0.1;ActionRequiredBehavior;ActionRequiredBehavior;draft;False;Defines expectations around whether an action or action group is required.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;must;Must;"An action with this behavior must be included in the actions processed by the end user; the end user SHALL NOT choose not to include this action.";;;
action-required-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-required-behavior;4.0.1;ActionRequiredBehavior;ActionRequiredBehavior;draft;False;Defines expectations around whether an action or action group is required.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;could;Could;An action with this behavior may be included in the set of actions processed by the end user.;;;
action-required-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-required-behavior;4.0.1;ActionRequiredBehavior;ActionRequiredBehavior;draft;False;Defines expectations around whether an action or action group is required.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;must-unless-documented;Must Unless Documented;An action with this behavior must be included in the set of actions processed by the end user, unless the end user provides documentation as to why the action was not included.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;any;Any;Any number of the actions in the group may be chosen, from zero to all.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;all;All;All the actions in the group must be selected as a single unit.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;all-or-none;All Or None;All the actions in the group are meant to be chosen as a single unit: either all must be selected by the end user, or none may be selected.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;exactly-one;Exactly One;The end user must choose one and only one of the selectable actions in the group. The user SHALL NOT choose none of the actions in the group.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;at-most-one;At Most One;The end user may choose zero or at most one of the actions in the group.;;;
action-selection-behavior;http://hl7.org/fhir/action-selection-behavior;4.0.1;ActionSelectionBehavior;ActionSelectionBehavior;draft;False;Defines selection behavior of a group.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;one-or-more;One Or More;The end user must choose a minimum of one, and as many additional as desired.;;;
