binding-strength;http://hl7.org/fhir/binding-strength;4.0.1;BindingStrength;BindingStrength;active;False;Indication of the degree of conformance expectations associated with a binding.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;;complete;required;Required;To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.;;;
