bundle-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/bundle-type;4.0.1;BundleType;BundleType;active;False;Indicates the purpose of a bundle - how it is intended to be used.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;transaction-response;Transaction Response;The bundle is a transaction response. Because the response is a transaction response, the transaction has succeeded, and all responses are error free.;;;
