capability-statement-kind;http://hl7.org/fhir/capability-statement-kind;4.0.1;CapabilityStatementKind;CapabilityStatementKind;active;False;How a capability statement is intended to be used.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;instance;Instance;The CapabilityStatement instance represents the present capabilities of a specific system instance.  This is the kind returned by /metadata for a FHIR server end-point.;;;
