contact-point-use;http://hl7.org/fhir/contact-point-use;4.0.1;ContactPointUse;ContactPointUse;active;False;Use of contact point.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;mobile;Mobile;A telecommunication device that moves and stays with its owner. May have characteristics of all other use codes, suitable for urgent matters, not the first choice for routine business.;;;
