data-types;http://hl7.org/fhir/data-types;4.0.1;DataType;DataType;active;False;A version specific list of the data types defined by the FHIR specification for use as an element  type (any of the FHIR defined data types).;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;Signature;Signature;A signature along with supporting context. The signature may be a digital signature that is cryptographic in nature, or some other signature acceptable to the domain. This other signature may be as simple as a graphical image representing a hand-written signature, or a signature ceremony Different signature approaches have different utilities.;;;
