data-types;http://hl7.org/fhir/data-types;4.0.1;DataType;DataType;active;False;A version specific list of the data types defined by the FHIR specification for use as an element  type (any of the FHIR defined data types).;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;date;date;A date or partial date (e.g. just year or year + month). There is no time zone. The format is a union of the schema types gYear, gYearMonth and date.  Dates SHALL be valid dates.;;;
data-types;http://hl7.org/fhir/data-types;4.0.1;DataType;DataType;active;False;A version specific list of the data types defined by the FHIR specification for use as an element  type (any of the FHIR defined data types).;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;dateTime;dateTime;A date, date-time or partial date (e.g. just year or year + month).  If hours and minutes are specified, a time zone SHALL be populated. The format is a union of the schema types gYear, gYearMonth, date and dateTime. Seconds must be provided due to schema type constraints but may be zero-filled and may be ignored.                 Dates SHALL be valid dates.;;;
