diagnostic-report-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/diagnostic-report-status;4.0.1;DiagnosticReportStatus;DiagnosticReportStatus;draft;False;The status of the diagnostic report.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;entered-in-error;Entered in Error;"The report has been withdrawn following a previous final release.  This electronic record should never have existed, though it is possible that real-world decisions were based on it. (If real-world activity has occurred, the status should be ""cancelled"" rather than ""entered-in-error"".).";;;
