dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;111767;SRK-T;"The SRK-T IOL calculation formula. Retzlaff JA, Sanders DR, Kraff MC. Development of the SRK/T intraocular lens implant power calculation formula. J Cataract Refract Surg 1990;16:333-40. Erratum 1990;16:528";;;
