dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;113904;CTDIvol Alert Value;"Cumulative CTDIvol value configured to trigger an alert; see NEMA XR 25-2010 Dose Check Standard";;;
dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;113905;Accumulated DLP Forward Estimate;"A forward estimate of the accumulated DLP plus the estimated DLP for the next Protocol Element Group; see NEMA XR 25-2010 Dose Check Standard";;;
dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;113906;Accumulated CTDIvol Forward Estimate;"A forward estimate at a given location of the accumulated CTDIvol plus the estimated CTDIvol for the next Protocol Element Group; see NEMA XR 25-2010 Dose Check Standard";;;
dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;113907;Reason for Proceeding;Reason provided for proceeding with a procedure that is projected to exceed a configured dose value;;;
