dicom-dcim;http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM;01;DICOM Controlled Terminology Definitions;;active;;"DICOM Code Definitions (Coding Scheme Designator ""DCM"" Coding Scheme Version ""01"")";2015-04-20;NEMA/DICOM;complete;121011;Person Observer's Role in this Procedure;Procedural role of human observer for the context of the current observation;;;
