insuranceplan-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/insurance-plan-type;4.0.1;InsurancePlanType;Insurance plan type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate a type of insurance plan.;;FHIR Project team;fragment;vision;Vision;;;;
insuranceplan-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/insurance-plan-type;4.0.1;InsurancePlanType;Insurance plan type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate a type of insurance plan.;;FHIR Project team;fragment;Drug;Drug;;;;
insuranceplan-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/insurance-plan-type;4.0.1;InsurancePlanType;Insurance plan type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate a type of insurance plan.;;FHIR Project team;fragment;short-term;Short Term;;;;
insuranceplan-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/insurance-plan-type;4.0.1;InsurancePlanType;Insurance plan type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate a type of insurance plan.;;FHIR Project team;fragment;long-term;Long Term Care;;;;
insuranceplan-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/insurance-plan-type;4.0.1;InsurancePlanType;Insurance plan type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate a type of insurance plan.;;FHIR Project team;fragment;hospice;Hospice;;;;
