list-mode;http://hl7.org/fhir/list-mode;4.0.1;ListMode;ListMode;draft;False;The processing mode that applies to this list.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;changes;Change List;A point-in-time list that shows what changes have been made or recommended.  E.g. a discharge medication list showing what was added and removed during an encounter.;;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;user;Sorted by User;The list was sorted by a user. The criteria the user used are not specified.;;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;system;Sorted by System;"The list was sorted by the system. The criteria the user used are not specified; define additional codes to specify a particular order (or use other defined codes).";;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;event-date;Sorted by Event Date;The list is sorted by the data of the event. This can be used when the list has items which are dates with past or future events.;;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;entry-date;Sorted by Item Date;The list is sorted by the date the item was added to the list. Note that the date added to the list is not explicit in the list itself.;;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;priority;Sorted by Priority;The list is sorted by priority. The exact method in which priority has been determined is not specified.;;;
list-order;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/list-order;4.0.1;ListOrderCodes;List Order Codes;draft;False;Base values for the order of the items in a list resource.;;FHIR Project;complete;alphabetic;Sorted Alphabetically;The list is sorted alphabetically by an unspecified property of the items in the list.;;;
