location-physical-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/location-physical-type;4.0.1;LocationType;Location type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate the physical form of the Location.;;FHIR Project team;complete;ro;Room;A space that is allocated as a room, it may have walls/roof etc., but does not require these.;;;
location-physical-type;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/location-physical-type;4.0.1;LocationType;Location type;draft;False;This example value set defines a set of codes that can be used to indicate the physical form of the Location.;;FHIR Project team;complete;bd;Bed;A space that is allocated for sleeping/laying on. This is not the physical bed/trolley that may be moved about, but the space it may occupy.;;;
