medicationdispense-performer-function;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-performer-function;4.0.1;MedicationDispense Performer Function Codes;Medication dispense  performer  function  codes;draft;False;MedicationDispense Performer Function Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;finalchecker;Final Checker;Performed the final quality assurance on the prepared medication against the request. Typically, this is a pharmacist function.;;;
