medicationdispense-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status-reason;4.0.1;MedicationDispense Status Reason Codes;Medication dispense  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationDispense Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;drughigh;Drug level too high;The current level of the medication in the patient's system is too high. The medication is suspended to allow the level to subside to a safer level.;;;
