medicationdispense-status;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationdispense-status;4.0.1;MedicationDispense Status Codes;Medication dispense  status  codes;draft;False;MedicationDispense Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;on-hold;On Hold;The dispense process is paused while waiting for an external event to reactivate the dispense.  For example, new stock has arrived or the prescriber has called.;;;
