medicationrequest-category;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-category;4.0.1;medicationRequest Category Codes;Medication request  category  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Category Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;inpatient;Inpatient;Includes requests for medications to be administered or consumed in an inpatient or acute care setting;;;
medicationrequest-category;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-category;4.0.1;medicationRequest Category Codes;Medication request  category  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Category Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;outpatient;Outpatient;Includes requests for medications to be administered or consumed in an outpatient setting (for example, Emergency Department, Outpatient Clinic, Outpatient Surgery, Doctor's office);;;
medicationrequest-category;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-category;4.0.1;medicationRequest Category Codes;Medication request  category  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Category Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;community;Community;Includes requests for medications to be administered or consumed by the patient in their home (this would include long term care or nursing homes, hospices, etc.);;;
medicationrequest-category;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-category;4.0.1;medicationRequest Category Codes;Medication request  category  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Category Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;discharge;Discharge;Includes requests for medications created when the patient is being released from a facility;;;
medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;4.0.1;medicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;Medication request  course of  therapy  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;continuous;Continuous long term therapy;A medication which is expected to be continued beyond the present order and which the patient should be assumed to be taking unless explicitly stopped.;;;
medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;4.0.1;medicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;Medication request  course of  therapy  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;acute;Short course (acute) therapy;A medication which the patient is only expected to consume for the duration of the current order and which is not expected to be renewed.;;;
medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-course-of-therapy;4.0.1;medicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;Medication request  course of  therapy  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Course of Therapy Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;seasonal;Seasonal;A medication which is expected to be used on a part time basis at certain times of the year;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;proposal;Proposal;The request is a suggestion made by someone/something that doesn't have an intention to ensure it occurs and without providing an authorization to act;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;plan;Plan;The request represents an intention to ensure something occurs without providing an authorization for others to act.;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;order;Order;The request represents a request/demand and authorization for action;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;original-order;Original Order;The request represents the original authorization for the medication request.;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;reflex-order;Reflex Order;The request represents an automatically generated supplemental authorization for action based on a parent authorization together with initial results of the action taken against that parent authorization..;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;filler-order;Filler Order;The request represents the view of an authorization instantiated by a fulfilling system representing the details of the fulfiller's intention to act upon a submitted order.;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;instance-order;Instance Order;The request represents an instance for the particular order, for example a medication administration record.;;;
medicationrequest-intent;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-intent;4.0.1;medicationRequest Intent;Medication request  intent;draft;False;MedicationRequest Intent Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;option;Option;The request represents a component or option for a RequestGroup that establishes timing, conditionality and/or  other constraints among a set of requests.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;altchoice;Try another treatment first;This therapy has been ordered as a backup to a preferred therapy. This order will be released when and if the preferred therapy is unsuccessful.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;clarif;Prescription requires clarification;Clarification is required before the order can be acted upon.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;drughigh;Drug level too high;The current level of the medication in the patient's system is too high. The medication is suspended to allow the level to subside to a safer level.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;hospadm;Admission to hospital;The patient has been admitted to a care facility and their community medications are suspended until hospital discharge.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;labint;Lab interference issues;The therapy would interfere with a planned lab test and the therapy is being withdrawn until the test is completed.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;non-avail;Patient not available;Patient not available for a period of time due to a scheduled therapy, leave of absence or other reason.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;preg;Parent is pregnant/breast feeding;The patient is pregnant or breast feeding. The therapy will be resumed when the pregnancy is complete and the patient is no longer breastfeeding.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;salg;Allergy;The patient is believed to be allergic to a substance that is part of the therapy and the therapy is being temporarily withdrawn to confirm.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;sddi;Drug interacts with another drug;The drug interacts with a short-term treatment that is more urgently required. This order will be resumed when the short-term treatment is complete.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;sdupther;Duplicate therapy;The drug interacts with a short-term treatment that is more urgently required. This order will be resumed when the short-term treatment is complete.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;sintol;Suspected intolerance;The drug interacts with a short-term treatment that is more urgently required. This order will be resumed when the short-term treatment is complete.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;surg;Patient scheduled for surgery.;The drug is contraindicated for patients receiving surgery and the patient is scheduled to be admitted for surgery in the near future. The drug will be resumed when the patient has sufficiently recovered from the surgery.;;;
medicationrequest-status-reason;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status-reason;4.0.1;medicationRequest Status Reason Codes;Medication request  status  reason  codes;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Reason Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;washout;Waiting for old drug to wash out;The patient was previously receiving a medication contraindicated with the current medication. The current medication will remain on hold until the prior medication has been cleansed from their system.;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;active;Active;The prescription is 'actionable', but not all actions that are implied by it have occurred yet.;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;on-hold;On Hold;Actions implied by the prescription are to be temporarily halted, but are expected to continue later.  May also be called 'suspended'.;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;cancelled;Cancelled;The prescription has been withdrawn before any administrations have occurred;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;completed;Completed;All actions that are implied by the prescription have occurred.;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;entered-in-error;Entered in Error;Some of the actions that are implied by the medication request may have occurred.  For example, the medication may have been dispensed and the patient may have taken some of the medication.  Clinical decision support systems should take this status into account;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;stopped;Stopped;Actions implied by the prescription are to be permanently halted, before all of the administrations occurred. This should not be used if the original order was entered in error;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;draft;Draft;The prescription is not yet 'actionable', e.g. it is a work in progress, requires sign-off, verification or needs to be run through decision support process.;;;
medicationrequest-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/CodeSystem/medicationrequest-status;4.0.1;medicationrequest Status;Medicationrequest  status;draft;False;MedicationRequest Status Codes;;FHIR Project team;complete;unknown;Unknown;The authoring/source system does not know which of the status values currently applies for this observation. Note: This concept is not to be used for 'other' - one of the listed statuses is presumed to apply, but the authoring/source system does not know which.;;;
