nhin-purposeofuse;http://healthit.gov/nhin/purposeofuse;2.0;NHIN PurposeOfUse;;active;False;This value set is suitable for use with the provenance resource. It is derived from, but not compatible with, the HL7 v3 Purpose of use Code system.;2010-01-29;Nationwide Health Information Network (NHIN);complete;PRESENT;Present;Uses and disclosures with the individual present.;;;
nhin-purposeofuse;http://healthit.gov/nhin/purposeofuse;2.0;NHIN PurposeOfUse;;active;False;This value set is suitable for use with the provenance resource. It is derived from, but not compatible with, the HL7 v3 Purpose of use Code system.;2010-01-29;Nationwide Health Information Network (NHIN);complete;EMERGENCY;Emergency;Permission cannot practicably be provided because of the individual's incapacity or an emergency.;;;
