questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;text;;UI controls relevant to rendering questionnaire text items;help;Help-Button;Text is displayed in a dialog box or similar control if invoked by pushing a button or some other UI-appropriate action to request 'help' for a question, group or the questionnaire as a whole (depending what the text is nested within)
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;autocomplete;Auto-complete;A control which provides a list of potential matches based on text entered into a control.  Used for large choice sets where text-matching is an appropriate discovery mechanism.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;drop-down;Drop down;A control where an item (or multiple items) can be selected from a list that is only displayed when the user is editing the field.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;check-box;Check-box;A control where choices are listed with a box beside them.  The box can be toggled to select or de-select a given choice.  Multiple selections may be possible.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;lookup;Lookup;A control where editing an item spawns a separate dialog box or screen permitting a user to navigate, filter or otherwise discover an appropriate match.  Useful for large choice sets where text matching is not an appropriate discovery mechanism.  Such screens must generally be tuned for the specific choice list structure.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;radio-button;Radio Button;A control where choices are listed with a button beside them.  The button can be toggled to select or de-select a given choice.  Selecting one item deselects all others.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;slider;Slider;A control where an axis is displayed between the high and low values and the control can be visually manipulated to select a value anywhere on the axis.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;spinner;Spinner;A control where a list of numeric or other ordered values can be scrolled through via arrows.
questionnaire-item-control;http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control;4.0.1;QuestionnaireItemUIControlCodes;Questionnaire Item UI Control Codes;draft;False;Starter set of user interface control/display mechanisms that might be used when rendering an item in a questionnaire.;;HL7 International - Patient Care WG;complete;question;;UI controls relevant to capturing question data;text-box;Text Box;A control where a user can type in their answer freely.
