request-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/request-status;4.0.1;RequestStatus;RequestStatus;draft;False;Codes identifying the lifecycle stage of a request.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;unknown;Unknown;"The authoring/source system does not know which of the status values currently applies for this request.  Note: This concept is not to be used for ""other"" - one of the listed statuses is presumed to apply,  but the authoring/source system does not know which.";;;
research-element-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/research-element-type;4.0.1;ResearchElementType;ResearchElementType;draft;False;The possible types of research elements (E.g. Population, Exposure, Outcome).;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;population;Population;The element defines the population that forms the basis for research.;;;
