research-study-reason-stopped;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/research-study-reason-stopped;4.0.1;ResearchStudyReasonStopped;ResearchStudyReasonStopped;draft;False;Codes for why the study ended prematurely.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;closed-due-to-toxicity;Closed due to toxicity;The study prematurely ended due to toxicity.;;;
research-study-reason-stopped;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/research-study-reason-stopped;4.0.1;ResearchStudyReasonStopped;ResearchStudyReasonStopped;draft;False;Codes for why the study ended prematurely.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;closed-due-to-lack-of-study-progress;Closed due to lack of study progress;The study prematurely ended due to lack of study progress.;;;
