research-study-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/research-study-status;4.0.1;ResearchStudyStatus;ResearchStudyStatus;draft;False;Codes that convey the current status of the research study.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;closed-to-accrual-and-intervention;Closed to Accrual and Intervention;Study is closed to accrual and intervention, i.e. the study is closed to enrollment, all study subjects have completed treatment or intervention but are still being followed according to the primary objective of the study.;;;
research-study-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/research-study-status;4.0.1;ResearchStudyStatus;ResearchStudyStatus;draft;False;Codes that convey the current status of the research study.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;completed;Completed;"Study is closed to accrual and intervention, i.e. the study is closed to enrollment, all study subjects have completed treatment
