resource-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/resource-status;4.0.1;Canonical Status Codes for FHIR Resources;;draft;;The master set of status codes used throughout FHIR. All status codes are mapped to one of these codes.;;FHIR Project;complete;complete;complete;The process described/requested in the resource has been completed, and no further action is planned;;;
resource-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/resource-status;4.0.1;Canonical Status Codes for FHIR Resources;;draft;;The master set of status codes used throughout FHIR. All status codes are mapped to one of these codes.;;FHIR Project;complete;inactive;inactive;The resource describes information that is no longer valid or a process that is stopped occurring;;;
resource-status;http://hl7.org/fhir/resource-status;4.0.1;Canonical Status Codes for FHIR Resources;;draft;;The master set of status codes used throughout FHIR. All status codes are mapped to one of these codes.;;FHIR Project;complete;abandoned;abandoned;The process described/requested in the resource did not complete - usually due to some workflow error, and no further action is planned;;;
