subscription-channel-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/subscription-channel-type;4.0.1;SubscriptionChannelType;SubscriptionChannelType;draft;False;The type of method used to execute a subscription.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;rest-hook;Rest Hook;The channel is executed by making a post to the URI. If a payload is included, the URL is interpreted as the service base, and an update (PUT) is made.;;;
