subscription-channel-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/subscription-channel-type;4.0.1;SubscriptionChannelType;SubscriptionChannelType;draft;False;The type of method used to execute a subscription.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;message;Message;The channel is executed by sending a message (e.g. a Bundle with a MessageHeader resource etc.) to the application identified in the URI.;;;
