udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;barcode;Barcode;a barcodescanner captured the data from the device label.;;;
udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;rfid;RFID;An RFID chip reader captured the data from the device label.;;;
udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;manual;Manual;The data was read from the label by a person and manually entered. (e.g.  via a keyboard).;;;
udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;card;Card;The data originated from a patient's implant card and was read by an operator.;;;
udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;self-reported;Self Reported;The data originated from a patient source and was not directly scanned or read from a label or card.;;;
udi-entry-type;http://hl7.org/fhir/udi-entry-type;4.0.1;UDIEntryType;UDIEntryType;draft;False;Codes to identify how UDI data was entered.;2019-11-01T09:29:23+11:00;HL7 (FHIR Project);complete;unknown;Unknown;The method of data capture has not been determined.;;;
