                        Suspension, license restrictions, monetary fine, letter of reprimand, mandated training, mandated supervision, etc.Examples:"
v3-ActClass;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActClass;2018-08-12;v3.ActClass;v3 Code System ActClass;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;ACT;act;"A record of something that is being done, has been done, can be done, or is intended or requested to be done.


