                              Device temperature



                              Soil lead level";POS;position;An observation denoting the physical location of a person or thing based on a reference coordinate system.
v3-ActClass;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActClass;2018-08-12;v3.ActClass;v3 Code System ActClass;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;POS;position;An observation denoting the physical location of a person or thing based on a reference coordinate system.;POSACC;position accuracy;Description:An observation representing the degree to which the assignment of the spatial coordinates, based on a matching algorithm by a geocoding engine against a reference spatial database, matches true or accepted values.
v3-ActClass;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActClass;2018-08-12;v3.ActClass;v3 Code System ActClass;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;POS;position;An observation denoting the physical location of a person or thing based on a reference coordinate system.;POSCOORD;position coordinate;Description:An observation representing one of a set of numerical values used to determine the position of a place.  The name of the coordinate value is determined by the reference coordinate system.
