                           Example: Reproductive health, sexually transmitted disease, and end renal disease programs.";ENDRENAL;end renal program;"Definition: A public or government program that administers publicly funded coverage of kidney dialysis and kidney transplant services.

                        Example: In the U.S., the Medicare End-stage Renal Disease program (ESRD), the National Kidney Foundation (NKF) American Kidney Fund (AKF) The Organ Transplant Fund."
