                        Map: Aligns with ISO 2382-8 definition of Compartment - ""A division of data into isolated blocks with separate security controls for the purpose of reducing risk.""";FMCOMPT;financial management compartment;"Financial management department members who have access to healthcare consumer information as part of a patient account, billing and claims workflows.

                        Security Compartment Labels assigned to consumer information used in these workflows should be met or exceeded by the Security Compartment attribute claimed by a participant in a financial management workflow who is requesting access to that information."
