v3-CommunicationFunctionType;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-CommunicationFunctionType;2018-08-12;v3.CommunicationFunctionType;v3 Code System CommunicationFunctionType;active;False; Describes the type of communication function that the associated entity plays in the associated transmission.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;RCV;receiver;The entity is the receiver of the transmission.;;;
v3-CommunicationFunctionType;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-CommunicationFunctionType;2018-08-12;v3.CommunicationFunctionType;v3 Code System CommunicationFunctionType;active;False; Describes the type of communication function that the associated entity plays in the associated transmission.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;RSP;respond to;The entity is the one to which the response or reply to the transmission should be sent.;;;
