v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_MedicationCap;MedicationCap;Cap types for medication containers;CHILD;ChildProof;A cap designed to be difficult to open for children.  Generally requires multiple simultaneous actions (e.g. squeeze and twist) to open.  Used for products that may be dangerous if ingested or overdosed by children.
v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_MedicationCap;MedicationCap;Cap types for medication containers;EASY;EasyOpen;A cap designed to be easily removed.  For products intended to be opened by persons with limited strength or dexterity.
v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;FILM;Film;A non-reactive plastic film covering over the opening of a container.;;;
v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;FOIL;Foil;A foil covering (type of foil not specified) over the opening of a container;;;
v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;PUSH;Push Cap;A non-threaded cap that forms a tight-fitting closure on a container by pushing the fitted end into the conatiner opening;;;
v3-ContainerCap;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ContainerCap;2018-08-12;v3.ContainerCap;v3 Code System ContainerCap;active;False; The type of cap associated with a container;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;SCR;Screw Cap;A threaded cap that is screwed onto the opening of a container;;;
