v3-DeviceAlertLevel;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-DeviceAlertLevel;2018-08-12;v3.DeviceAlertLevel;v3 Code System DeviceAlertLevel;active;False; Domain values for the Device.Alert_levelCode;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;C;Critical;Shut Down, Fix Problem and Re-initialize;;;
