v3-EntityHandling;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-EntityHandling;2018-08-12;v3.EntityHandling;v3 Code System EntityHandling;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;REF;Refrigerated temperature;Keep at refrigerated temperature:4-8C Accidental warming or freezing is of little consequence.;;;
