v3-HL7ContextConductionStyle;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7ContextConductionStyle;2018-08-12;v3.HL7ContextConductionStyle;v3 Code System HL7ContextConductionStyle;active;False;The styles of context conduction usable by relationships within a static model derived from tyhe HL7 Reference Information Model.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;V;vocabulary-based;"Definition: Context conduction is defined using the ActRelationship.blockedContextActRelationshipType and blockedContextParticipationType attributes and the ""conductible"" property on the ActRelationshipType and ParticipationType code systems.";;;
