v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;A;Add;Description:The item was (or is to be) added, having not been present immediately before. (If it is already present, this may be treated as an error condition.);;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;AR;Add or Replace;Description:The item was (or is to be) either added or replaced.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;D;Remove;Description:The item was (or is to be) removed (sometimes referred to as deleted). If the item is part of a collection, delete any matching items.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;K;Key;Description:This item is part of the identifying information for this object.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;N;No Change;Description:There was (or is to be) no change to the item. This is primarily used when this element has not changed, but other attributes in the instance have changed.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;R;Replace;Description:The item existed previously and has (or is to be) revised. (If an item does not already exist, this may be treated as an error condition.);;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;REF;Reference;Description:This item provides enough information to allow a processing system to locate the full applicable record by identifying the object.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;U;Unknown;Description:Description:</b>It is not specified whether or what kind of change has occurred to the item, or whether the item is present as a reference or identifying property.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SetUpdateMode;SetUpdateMode;These concepts apply when the element and/or message is updating a set of items.;ESA;Set Add;Add the message element to the collection of items on the receiving system that correspond to the message element.
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SetUpdateMode;SetUpdateMode;These concepts apply when the element and/or message is updating a set of items.;ESAC;Set Add or Change;"Change the item on the receiving system that corresponds to this message element; if a matching element does not exist, add a new one created with the values in the message."
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SetUpdateMode;SetUpdateMode;These concepts apply when the element and/or message is updating a set of items.;ESC;Set Change;"Change the item on the receiving system that corresponds to this message element; do not process if a matching element does not exist."
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SetUpdateMode;SetUpdateMode;These concepts apply when the element and/or message is updating a set of items.;ESD;Set Delete;Delete the item on the receiving system that corresponds to this message element.
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;AU;Add or Update;Description: AU: If this item exists, update it with these values. If it does not exist, create it with these values. If the item is part of the collection, update each item that matches this item, and if no items match, add a new item to the collection.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;I;Ignore;Ignore this role, it is not relevant to the update.;;;
v3-HL7UpdateMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HL7UpdateMode;2018-08-12;v3.HL7UpdateMode;v3 Code System HL7UpdateMode;active;False; The possible modes of updating that occur when an attribute is received by a system that already contains values for that attribute.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;V;Verify;Verify - this message element must match a value already in the receiving systems database in order to process the message.;;;
v3-hl7V3Conformance;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-hl7V3Conformance;2018-08-12;v3.hl7V3Conformance;v3 Code System hl7V3Conformance;active;False;"  Description:
Identifies allowed codes for HL7aTMs v3 conformance property.";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;I;ignored;"Description: Implementers receiving this property must not raise an error if the data is received, but will not perform any useful function with the data.  This conformance level is not used in profiles or other artifacts that are specific to the ""sender"" or ""initiator"" of a communication.";;;
v3-hl7V3Conformance;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-hl7V3Conformance;2018-08-12;v3.hl7V3Conformance;v3 Code System hl7V3Conformance;active;False;"  Description:
