Identifies allowed codes for HL7aTMs v3 conformance property.";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;R;required;Description: All implementers must support this property.  I.e. they must be able to transmit, or to receive and usefully handle the concept.;;;
v3-hl7V3Conformance;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-hl7V3Conformance;2018-08-12;v3.hl7V3Conformance;v3 Code System hl7V3Conformance;active;False;"  Description:
Identifies allowed codes for HL7aTMs v3 conformance property.";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;RC;required for consumer;"Description: The element is considered ""required"" (i.e. must be supported) from the perspective of systems that consume  instances, but is ""undetermined"" for systems that generate instances.  Used only as part of specifications that define both initiator and consumer expectations.";;;
v3-hl7V3Conformance;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-hl7V3Conformance;2018-08-12;v3.hl7V3Conformance;v3 Code System hl7V3Conformance;active;False;"  Description:
