v3-HtmlLinkType;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-HtmlLinkType;2018-08-12;v3.HtmlLinkType;v3 Code System HtmlLinkType;active;False; HtmlLinkType values are drawn from HTML 4.0 and describe the relationship between the current document and the anchor that is the target of the link;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;start;start;Refers to the first document in a collection of documents. This link type tells search engines which document is considered by the author to be the starting point of the collection.;;;
