v3-ManagedParticipationStatus;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ManagedParticipationStatus;2018-08-12;v3.ManagedParticipationStatus;v3 Code System ManagedParticipationStatus;active;False; Codes representing the defined possible states of a Managed Participation, as defined by the Managed Participation class state machine.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;normal;normal;"The 'typical' state. Excludes ""nullified"" which represents the termination state of a participation instance that was created in error.";active;active;The state representing the fact that the Participation is in progress.
