                           Those properties further qualify the nature of what is unknown.  (E.g. specifying a use code of ""H"" and a URL prefix of ""tel:"" to convey that it is the home phone number that is unknown.)";NASK;not asked;This information has not been sought (e.g., patient was not asked)
