                           Those properties further qualify the nature of what is unknown.  (E.g. specifying a use code of ""H"" and a URL prefix of ""tel:"" to convey that it is the home phone number that is unknown.)";NAVU;Not available;Information is not available at this time (with no expectation regarding whether it will or will not be available in the future).
