                        Synonym: Above high normal";H>;Significantly high;"A test result that is significantly higher than the reference (normal) or therapeutic interval, but has not reached the critically high value and might need special attention, as defined by the laboratory or the clinician.[Note: This level is situated between 'H' and 'HH'.]


