                        Synonym: Below low normal";L<;Significantly low;"A test result that is significantly lower than the reference (normal) or therapeutic interval, but has not reached the critically low value and might need special attention, as defined by the laboratory or the clinician.[Note: This level is situated between 'L' and 'LL'.]


