Description copied from Concept Domain of same name.  Must be corrected..";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SECALTINTOBV;alteration integrity;Abstract security metadata observation values used to indicate mechanism used for authorized alteration of an IT resource (data, information object, service, or system capability);AGGRED;aggregated;Security metadata observation values used to indicate the use of an algorithmic combination of actual values with the result of an aggregate function, e.g., average, sum, or count in order to limit disclosure of an IT resource (data, information object, service, or system capability) to the minimum necessary.
