v3-ObservationValue;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ObservationValue;2018-08-12;v3.ObservationValue;v3 Code System ObservationValue;active;False;" This domain is the root domain to which all HL7-recognized value sets for the Observation.value attribute will be linked when Observation.value has a coded data type.  OpenIssue:
Description copied from Concept Domain of same name.  Must be corrected..";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_SECALTINTOBV;alteration integrity;Abstract security metadata observation values used to indicate mechanism used for authorized alteration of an IT resource (data, information object, service, or system capability);TRSLT;translated;"Security metadata observation value used to indicate that the IT resource has been translated from one human language to another.


