v3-ParticipationSignature;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationSignature;2018-08-12;v3.ParticipationSignature;v3 Code System ParticipationSignature;active;False;" A set of codes specifying whether and how the participant has attested his participation through a signature and or whether such a signature is needed.  Examples:
A surgical Procedure act object (representing a procedure report) requires a signature of the performing and responsible surgeon, and possibly other participants. (See also: Participation.signatureText.)";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;I;intended;The particpant intends to provide a signature.;;;
