v3-PaymentTerms;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PaymentTerms;2018-08-12;v3.PaymentTerms;v3 Code System PaymentTerms;active;False; Describes payment terms for a financial transaction, used in an invoice. This is typically expressed as a responsibility of the acceptor or payor of an invoice.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;COD;Cash on Delivery;Payment in full for products and/or services is required as soon as the service is performed or goods delivered.;;;
v3-PaymentTerms;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PaymentTerms;2018-08-12;v3.PaymentTerms;v3 Code System PaymentTerms;active;False; Describes payment terms for a financial transaction, used in an invoice. This is typically expressed as a responsibility of the acceptor or payor of an invoice.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;N30;Net 30 days;Payment in full for products and/or services is required 30 days from the time the service is performed or goods delivered.;;;
v3-PaymentTerms;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PaymentTerms;2018-08-12;v3.PaymentTerms;v3 Code System PaymentTerms;active;False; Describes payment terms for a financial transaction, used in an invoice. This is typically expressed as a responsibility of the acceptor or payor of an invoice.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;N60;Net 60 days;Payment in full for products and/or services is required 60 days from the time the service is performed or goods delivered.;;;
v3-PaymentTerms;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PaymentTerms;2018-08-12;v3.PaymentTerms;v3 Code System PaymentTerms;active;False; Describes payment terms for a financial transaction, used in an invoice. This is typically expressed as a responsibility of the acceptor or payor of an invoice.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;N90;Net 90 days;Payment in full for products and/or services is required 90 days from the time the service is performed or goods delivered.;;;
