v3-PersonDisabilityType;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PersonDisabilityType;2018-08-12;v3.PersonDisabilityType;v3 Code System PersonDisabilityType;active;False; A code identifying a person's disability.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;5;Mobility impaired;Mobility impaired;CR;Requires crutches;Person requires crutches to ambulate
v3-PersonDisabilityType;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-PersonDisabilityType;2018-08-12;v3.PersonDisabilityType;v3 Code System PersonDisabilityType;active;False; A code identifying a person's disability.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;5;Mobility impaired;Mobility impaired;G;Requires gurney;A gurney is required to move the person
