v3-ProcessingMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ProcessingMode;2018-08-12;v3.ProcessingMode;v3 Code System ProcessingMode;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;A;Archive;Identifies archive mode of processing.;;;
v3-ProcessingMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ProcessingMode;2018-08-12;v3.ProcessingMode;v3 Code System ProcessingMode;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;I;Initial load;Identifies initial load mode of processing.;;;
v3-ProcessingMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ProcessingMode;2018-08-12;v3.ProcessingMode;v3 Code System ProcessingMode;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;R;Restore from archive;Identifies restore mode of processing.;;;
v3-ProcessingMode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ProcessingMode;2018-08-12;v3.ProcessingMode;v3 Code System ProcessingMode;active;False;**** MISSING DEFINITIONS ****;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;T;Current processing;Identifies on-line mode of processing.;;;
v3-QueryParameterValue;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-QueryParameterValue;2018-08-12;v3.QueryParameterValue;v3 Code System QueryParameterValue;active;False; The domain of coded values used as parameters within QueryByParameter queries.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_DispenseQueryFilterCode;dispense query filter code;Description:Filter codes used to manage volume of dispenses returned by  a parameter-based queries.;ALLDISP;all dispenses;Description:Returns all dispenses to date for a prescription.
v3-QueryParameterValue;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-QueryParameterValue;2018-08-12;v3.QueryParameterValue;v3 Code System QueryParameterValue;active;False; The domain of coded values used as parameters within QueryByParameter queries.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_DispenseQueryFilterCode;dispense query filter code;Description:Filter codes used to manage volume of dispenses returned by  a parameter-based queries.;LASTDISP;last dispense;Description:Returns the most recent dispense for a prescription.
v3-QueryParameterValue;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-QueryParameterValue;2018-08-12;v3.QueryParameterValue;v3 Code System QueryParameterValue;active;False; The domain of coded values used as parameters within QueryByParameter queries.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_DispenseQueryFilterCode;dispense query filter code;Description:Filter codes used to manage volume of dispenses returned by  a parameter-based queries.;NODISP;no dispense;Description:Returns no dispense for a prescription.
