Defines the units associated with the magnitude of the maximum size limit of a query response that can be accepted by the requesting application.";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;_QueryRequestLimit;QueryRequestLimit;Definition: The number of matching instances (number of focal classes). The document header class is the focal class of a document, a record would therefore be equal to a document.;RD;record;Definition: The number of matching instances (number of focal classes). The document header class is the focal class of a document, a record would therefore be equal to a document.
