v3-ResponseLevel;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ResponseLevel;2018-08-12;v3.ResponseLevel;v3 Code System ResponseLevel;active;False; Specifies whether a response is expected from the addressee of this interaction and what level of detail that response should include;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;X;none;Do not send any kind of response;;;
