v3-RoleCode;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleCode;2018-08-12;v3.RoleCode;v3 Code System RoleCode;active;False;" A set of codes further specifying the kind of Role; specific classification codes for further qualifying RoleClass codes.";2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;HLAB;hospital laboratory;Description: A location that plays the role of delivering services which may include tests done based on clinical specimens to get health information about a patient as pertaining to the diagnosis, treatment and prevention of disease.  Hospital laboratories may be further divided into specialized units such as Anatomic Pathology, Microbiology, and Biochemistry.;OUTLAB;outpatient laboratory;Description: A location that plays the role of delivering services which may include tests are done on clinical specimens to get health information about a patient pertaining to the diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of disease for same day visits.
