v3-RoleStatus;http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleStatus;2018-08-12;v3.RoleStatus;v3 Code System RoleStatus;active;False; Codes representing the defined possible states of an Role, as defined by the Role class state machine.;2018-08-12T00:00:00+10:00;HL7, Inc;complete;normal;normal;"The 'typical' state. Excludes ""nullified"" which represents the termination state of a Role instance that was created in error.";suspended;suspended;"The state that represents a suspension of the Entity playing the Role. This state is arrived at from the ""active"" state."
